cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OpenVPN Certificate Inspector (ovpncert)"
abstract: >-
  A handshake-only OpenVPN control-channel client that retrieves and verifies the X.509 certificate
  of an OpenVPN server without credentials (UDP/TCP, tls-auth, tls-crypt), diagnoses certificate
  verification failures, writes client-specific temporary peer-fingerprint profiles, and provides
  expiry monitoring, validated against real OpenVPN 2.6 and OpenVPN 3 clients.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gharooni
    given-names: Mehran
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mhrnqaruni/openvpn-cert-inspector"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-22
keywords:
  - OpenVPN
  - TLS
  - X.509
  - certificate monitoring
  - certificate pinning
  - network security
